Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:43.26,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Men fight on a mission to save Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.26,0:00:46.01,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Moeru roman
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.26,0:00:46.01,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{moeru roman}It's a burning passion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.35,0:00:52.66,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.35,0:00:52.66,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu}Someone has to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:01:01.11,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:01:01.11,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba}We are the trusted ones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.85,0:01:08.45,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.85,0:01:08.45,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.45,0:01:15.47,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.45,0:01:15.47,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.47,0:02:02.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,Sabera, the White Silver Priestess…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.19,0:02:22.51,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You're one of a kind because\N you're different from Gatlantians.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.69,0:02:28.50,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Yet, this is such a crude task.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.16,0:02:38.31,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.11,0:02:47.55,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,I'm not concerned about what could happen\N to me, as long as I can help you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.87,0:02:56.46,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,I am Sabera...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:02:59.51,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,...one of a kind...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.21,0:03:07.19,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,...and the priestess, who manages\N the Comet Metropolis Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.43,0:03:40.52,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Desler Cannon ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:44.81,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,It's similar to the wave motion gun in principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.81,0:03:49.12,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,When we were trapped within the alternate space,\N a similar signature was observed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:53.25,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,If Gatlantis has obtained the Desler Cannon…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.25,0:03:55.25,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,So, why me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:05.34,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Who else on this ship can I ask ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.35,0:04:12.44,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,What's on your mind ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.46,0:04:16.21,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,You started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.21,0:04:20.37,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,We can cooperate on this ship if both\N of us are honest with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:23.06,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,We are one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:26.47,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}One of a kind…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.26,0:04:33.17,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,I wonder…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:04:59.97,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Any update  ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:01.97,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Still working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:08.46,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,They say our position was being\N leaked during the last battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.61,0:05:10.36,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\a5\fscx152\fscy117\pos(894,722)}Meeting in Progress \NNo Entry Permitted
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.46,0:05:14.61,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,Just like Professor what's his name, someone on \Nthe ship might be getting manipulated by the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.61,0:05:16.61,def2,SAWAMURA,0,0,0,,Aren't we suspects, too ?{Even we're suspected, right ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.24,0:05:21.36,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,We were away from the Yamato, carrying \Nout a separate mission on the 11th planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:24.21,def2,TSURUMI,0,0,0,,Same for what's her face in the sickbay…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.21,0:05:25.90,def2,TSURUMI,0,0,0,,...Katsuragi Touko.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.33,0:05:30.66,def2,SAWAMURA,0,0,0,,Geez, we don't have much time until\N we make contact with the White Comet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.66,0:05:33.10,def2,TSURUMI,0,0,0,,We have no proof whether\N it's the enemy's main base or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.61,0:05:35.33,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Proof…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.20,0:05:43.80,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,This is as much detail as we can make out \Nwith the optical sensors{analysis} at our current distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.31,0:05:50.61,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,So, that's the White Comet…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:05.73,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,His Majesty{Great Emperor} predicted Desler's rebellion ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:10.22,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,Of course. His Majesty is\N aware of Garmillas' moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:17.18,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,That crook was fooled by his emotion, and tried to destroy the Yamato by sacrificing his own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.23,0:06:24.71,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,Even if he's a rare sample, our \Ncommunication with Mr. Mill was cut off, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.71,0:06:25.91,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.71,0:06:29.25,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Let him do as he likes for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.82,0:06:49.99,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,We've gained enough energy\N from Telezart in order to warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:53.66,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,We'll head for Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.61,0:06:58.01,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...the home to the ship called by Teresa…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.01,0:07:01.21,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{horobi}That poor planet destined to be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.71,0:07:06.06,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{sorosoro}I've grown tired of seeing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.95,0:07:20.01,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}What…was that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.01,0:07:22.34,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Ms. Katsuragi, what's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:24.31,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.31,0:07:26.96,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Can I help you, umm...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:28.01,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Yamamoto Akira.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.39,0:07:30.71,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,This is sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.71,0:07:32.81,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,A spy that can't remember my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:35.51,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,What're you talking about ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.51,0:07:37.01,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,I heard from Lieutenant Keyman...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.01,0:07:39.56,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,...that you're a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.32,0:07:42.21,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.66,0:07:46.16,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,You aren't going to deny you're a spy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.16,0:07:48.92,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,If the Lieutenant said so, he's probably right…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.04,0:07:53.45,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,…because we are open with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:04.63,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Your trick question was cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.85,0:08:08.92,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Do you...like him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:13.02,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,That emotion will…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:15.06,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.94,0:08:25.30,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Kodai, she's made a move !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.90,0:08:32.21,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}All hands, arm yourself with B equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.21,0:08:33.73,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Close all bulkheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.73,0:08:36.07,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{genzai}Currently, Katsuragi Touko is on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:39.66,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{teki}She's suspected of being an enemy spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.66,0:08:42.05,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Whoever finds her, report to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.87,0:08:45.44,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Really ?\N I can't believe Touko's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.03,0:08:47.01,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.01,0:08:49.66,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,If she's a Gatlantis soldier,\N she might self-detonate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:54.71,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Your Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:09:00.36,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I'm the White Silver Priestess…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.26,0:09:05.47,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}…the only one who manages \Nthe Comet Metropolis Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.98,0:09:34.75,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Are you alright ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.09,0:09:35.91,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:40.56,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:46.10,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Sorry, she got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:49.21,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I've got all the cameras monitoring the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:50.28,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time until we find…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:52.26,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Wha…?\N The White Comet…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:53.94,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,…the White Comet vanished !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.11,0:09:59.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What ?\N What happened ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:01.66,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.66,0:10:04.51,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,If the data's correct, it just vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.97,0:10:10.56,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,What's this vibration ?\N Engine room ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:13.49,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Gravitational interference\N wave detected at 12 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.85,0:10:30.58,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:33.29,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Turn 180 degrees, all hands…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.31,0:10:56.91,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,We're being pulled in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.91,0:10:58.63,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Different pattern on the gas surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.63,0:10:59.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.59,0:11:03.68,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,A powerful gravitational interference wave appears to be emitting from the center of the comet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:08.85,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,That's no natural phenomenon.\N It's targeting the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:12.40,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,They can control this much hyper gravity ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:18.79,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,I knew it.\NThis is the main base of Gatlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.40,0:11:29.26,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,It's like a solar flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:32.13,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Even with our wave motion shield, \Na direct hit is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.95,0:11:39.43,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,This feeling again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.77,0:11:43.81,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Who…who's playing this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:47.06,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,Just like the Silver White Priestess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:49.14,def2,LAZERA,0,0,0,,No one else can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:56.63,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I'm Sifar Sabera.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.72,0:12:01.01,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Gatlantians reproduce by cloning...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.91,0:12:04.20,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}...but I'm the only one…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.83,0:12:07.51,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Yamato…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.51,0:12:12.98,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,…the ship that disturbs his mind, \Nand brings harm to Gatlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.18,0:12:26.11,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Are you…going to kill me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.53,0:12:48.01,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who's talking to me from there ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:50.63,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:54.86,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,I'm Sabera.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.14,0:13:01.63,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,No, I am Sabera, the mediator who leads the Comet Metropolis Empire to enlightenment…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:04.96,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,…and manages it, according to His Majesty's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:06.66,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,…for His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:08.50,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:10.82,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,Who am I ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.64,0:13:16.94,def2,BOTH,0,0,0,,I'm Sabera, one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:19.81,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,The gravitational interference wave has weakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.55,0:13:22.46,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Now's the time, Shima !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.13,0:13:28.26,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Is this…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:31.20,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,A resonance between the two Saberas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.21,0:13:33.66,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,We were careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.66,0:13:39.26,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,We've never let two pure bodies \Ncome this close before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:41.16,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.16,0:13:42.26,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:48.56,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Pure bodies are different from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:51.11,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Two of them can't coexist…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:13:59.47,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.26,0:14:11.53,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You're one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.03,0:14:14.26,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,Your Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.07,0:14:18.26,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,The only human who can punish other humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.07,0:14:25.21,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You aren't obeying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:28.56,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I'm obeying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:33.87,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,The last human, Sifar Sabera.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.31,0:15:16.95,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty…this is your…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.97,0:15:26.27,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Klaus Keyman…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:29.26,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Shoot...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.26,0:15:33.75,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,...before I get caught and start confessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:43.99,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Maintain maximum output !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.99,0:15:50.01,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,No use !\NWe're still being pulled in !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:52.01,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,We've entered the interior of the White Comet !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.09,0:16:02.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:04.61,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,A large fleet of enemy warships.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:06.11,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Shima !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.90,0:16:08.73,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,No, I can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:30.35,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Why aren't they firing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.73,0:16:44.42,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.66,0:16:50.11,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Sabera's resonance made \Neveryone stand to attention.{Sabera's resonance made\N everyone pay attention to it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.29,0:16:53.66,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,That's enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.21,0:16:58.58,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Prepare for a phase-shifting dimensional transposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.51,0:17:02.81,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Sabera, what's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:06.60,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Sabera…Sabera !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.15,0:17:19.73,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,What are you doing ? \NYou were going to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.71,0:17:21.73,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Why did you…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:24.92,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Indeed, this is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.25,0:17:29.64,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}This feeling…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.94,0:17:34.26,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}In a distant past, he…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.21,0:17:38.69,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}…he and I suffered from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.64,0:17:42.73,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I can never break free.{'t break free forever.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.35,0:17:50.79,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}But it's a warm suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:17:58.65,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Sabera…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:02.66,def2,GAILNAE,0,0,0,,You're not a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.26,0:18:06.21,def2,GAILNAE,0,0,0,,The two are resonating with each other.{themselves.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.21,0:18:07.45,def2,GAILNAE,0,0,0,,At this rate…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:10.31,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Get out…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.99,0:18:15.89,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Everyone, get the hell out !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:20.37,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}What is this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:24.62,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Is this love…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:30.30,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}…which has made me and Zorder suffer ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.51,0:18:35.41,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Why must we repeat this same cycle ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:58.66,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.66,0:18:59.77,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,...Zorder…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.75,0:19:08.31,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You're the White Silver Priestess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:12.23,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,I'm Sifar Sabera.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.84,0:19:16.85,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You know love will lead humans to ruin.{make mistakes.}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:23.06,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,Yes, I know what love is, so do{ you}…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.06,0:19:24.24,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,No !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.40,0:19:30.63,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I've identified the center of the \Ngravitational wave that's pulling the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:33.48,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Putting the visual analysis on the main panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.44,0:19:46.91,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Diameter is 6,800 km,\N almost the same size as Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.49,0:19:50.33,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,A planet inside a comet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.47,0:19:55.12,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Could that be Gatlantis'…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.22,0:20:00.53,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,Let's end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.89,0:20:06.75,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,As I told you before, we're inside your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.29,0:20:08.55,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.83,0:20:13.19,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,What you're trying to \Ndestroy is not the universe, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.19,0:20:14.49,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.49,0:20:15.97,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,…your own…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.61,0:20:42.91,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,The gravitational wave is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:45.24,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Now, get ready to warp !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.69,0:20:53.45,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Warp !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.89,0:21:11.16,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Warp complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.16,0:21:12.80,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Engine normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.47,0:21:18.16,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Even though Gatlantis has such \Na large force, they didn't attack.{ at all.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:25.07,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We might be insignificant to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:39.54,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Gailane, get a new priestess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.43,0:21:44.35,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,How many have there been ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.65,0:21:54.05,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,The copies have restricted memories, so why do they regain the memory of the original, one after another ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.62,0:22:09.92,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,I've contacted Earth HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.91,0:22:13.13,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We should continue our quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.26,0:22:21.73,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,That massive Gatlantis still wants the power of Telezart, and we must end the seizure.
