Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.49,0:25:00.37,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,You will eventually betray the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.37,0:25:02.39,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You have no such thing \Nas ideals in your society ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.39,0:25:04.02,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,We're gonna kick their ass !
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.02,0:25:04.93,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Tsurumi, break away !
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.93,0:25:06.93,def2,TSURUMI,0,0,0,,Damn, until the Yamato arrives…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.94,0:25:10.46,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The Yamato has no future unless\N you break its curse yourself.
